-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 4, §4.4 קביעות
-- Tenure in special education is not absolute: where the Ministry finds a
-- framework no longer needed, its staff may be ended there at once and
-- re-placed elsewhere.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `4.4 קביעות`

DECLARE `special-education framework decision` HAS
    `the Ministry found the framework no longer needed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the Ministry of Education determined that the institution, class or other special-education framework is no longer needed

-- The one notice 4.4.2 permits: of the end of the employees' posts in that
-- class, institution or framework AND of their re-placement in another
-- framework they are entitled to ("על סיום תפקידם ... ושיבוצם מחדש").
DECLARE `framework action` IS ONE OF
    `give notice ending the post in the framework and re-placing the employee in another framework they are entitled to`

§§ `4.4.1`

@ref akn:chp_4__sec_4_4__hc_2__para_1__subpara_1
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `tenure in special education is absolute` IS FALSE

§§ `4.4.2`

-- "ניתן להודיע לאלתר": a permission to give, at once (WITHIN 0, in days),
-- one notice of the end of the post and of the re-placement in another
-- framework the employee is entitled to. Which frameworks those are is not
-- said here. Where the Ministry has made no such finding the paragraph says
-- nothing, so it imposes nothing (FULFILLED).
@ref akn:chp_4__sec_4_4__hc_2__para_2
GIVEN f IS A `special-education framework decision`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `framework action`
DECIDE `ending a framework that is no longer needed` f IS
    IF f's `the Ministry found the framework no longer needed`
    THEN PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
         MAY   `give notice ending the post in the framework and re-placing the employee in another framework they are entitled to`
         WITHIN 0
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- akn:chp_4__sec_4_4__hc_3__para_1 Source (אסמכתא): a Director-General's circular.
-- akn:chp_4__sec_4_4__hc_3__para_2 Source (אסמכתא): a clarification letter of the conditions-of-service department.

#ASSERT NOT `tenure in special education is absolute`
#TRACE `ending a framework that is no longer needed` (`special-education framework decision` WITH `the Ministry found the framework no longer needed` IS TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `give notice ending the post in the framework and re-placing the employee in another framework they are entitled to` AT 0
